# Settings window: Material 1040x700 at 440,205 (page column from x~772); Glass 860x620 at 530,230. Sidebar rows (Material, x=560): Appearance 335, Wallpaper 385, Desktop 435, Menu bar 485, Lock 535, Notifications 626, Focus 676, Windows 767, Displays 858.
# Click coordinates inside pages are not known in advance: those steps are MANUAL unless a keyboard path exists. Check in each look.
ipc panels settings security
wait 2
shot sec-top
note S1 Security page top: same groups, texts, footers and order as QML; no Fingerprint/Face groups when the sandbox has no reader or IR camera.
ptr move 1100 600 scroll 0 5
wait 1
shot sec-end
note S1 end of Security page: same groups, footers and order as QML (Firewall detail sentence identical in both shells; S4).
note S3 note whether 'Fast transfers without asking' shows: it must match QML for the same config (sharing.quickShareHotspot).
# MANUAL: S2 Screen sharing segmented control: click Dot, Both, Island in turn (read x/y from sec-top; 240 px wide at the row's right); detail changes to the three texts and config privacy.screenShareIndicator follows.
# MANUAL: S2 with island.enabled false (Notifications > Island off, then back): detail 'The island is off, so a share shows as the purple dot.'
# MANUAL: never flip 'Fast transfers without asking' or press the Firewall buttons (changes system security)
